{"ticker":"VTR","updated":"2026-10-30T23:22:25Z","profile":{"longName":"Ventas, Inc.","shortName":"Ventas, Inc.","sector":"Real Estate","industry":"REIT - Healthcare Facilities","country":"United States","website":"https://www.ventasreit.com","fullTimeEmployees":542,"marketCap":44843937792,"trailingPE":163.07693,"forwardPE":107.341774,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":6.65153,"pegRatio":4.77,"targetMeanPrice":99.72727,"targetHighPrice":113.0,"targetLowPrice":90.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":22,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.215,"earningsGrowth":-0.091,"grossMargins":0.39338002,"operatingMargins":0.12295,"profitMargins":0.03887,"totalRevenue":6741898240,"beta":0.741,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":101.6,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":72.66,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":2.48},"summary":"Ventas, Inc. is an S&P 500 company enabling exceptional environments that benefit a large and growing aging population. With approximately 1,450 properties in North America and the United Kingdom, Ventas occupies an essential role in the longevity economy. The Company's growth is fueled by its more than 900 senior housing communities, which provide valuable services to residents and enable them to thrive in supported environments. Ventas aims to deliver outsized performance by leveraging its operational expertise, data-driven insights from its Ventas OITM platform, extensive relationships and strong financial position. The Ventas portfolio also includes outpatient medical buildings, research centers and healthcare facilities. Ventas, Inc. is based in Illinois, Chicago. Ventas, Inc. was incorporated in 1983 in Maryland.","summary_zh":"Ventas, Inc. 是一家標準普爾 500 強公司，其卓越的環境造福於大量且不斷增長的老齡化人口。 Ventas 在北美和英國擁有約 1,450 處房產，在長壽經濟中發揮重要作用。該公司的成長得益於其 900 多個老年住房社區，這些社區為居民提供有價值的服務，使他們能夠在支持的環境中茁壯成長。 Ventas 旨在利用其營運專業知識、Ventas OITM 平台的數據驅動洞察、廣泛的關係和強大的財務狀況來提供卓越的業績。 Ventas 的投資組合還包括門診醫療大樓、研究中心和醫療設施。 Ventas, Inc. 總部位於伊利諾州芝加哥。 Ventas, Inc. 於 1983 年在馬裡蘭州成立。","sector_zh":"房地產","industry_zh